✅ WEEK 1 – PROJECT INITIALIZATION & PROBLEM UNDERSTANDING
Project Title

Agri Yield Prediction using Machine Learning

Problem Statement

Agricultural yield prediction plays a crucial role in supporting farmers and policymakers by enabling better planning, resource allocation, and decision-making. Traditional methods rely heavily on manual estimation and historical intuition, which are often inaccurate due to climate variability and soil conditions.
This project aims to build a machine learning–based system that predicts crop yield using historical agricultural data.

Objectives

Understand the problem domain of crop yield prediction

Identify key factors affecting agricultural yield

Explore machine learning as a solution for prediction

Plan the project workflow and technology stack

Proposed Solution

The proposed system uses machine learning models trained on historical crop data such as crop type, area, season, and production.
A web-based application will allow users to input agricultural parameters and receive predicted crop yield.
